ta.html（一枚目写真）\n\n↓スーツ・ベストのカラー参考\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/psdf94yqrwj830x/Untitled%20%281%29.png?dl=0\n\n↓サイズ、長さ・幅・高さ参考\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/dmiftybsisbku6r/image0.jpg?dl=0\nこちらのイラストを目安にしていただけますようお願いいたします。\n\n\nその他特徴\n・役職は古書店員、佐川急便のバイト。\n・クラスは巻き込まれの人。\n\n↓キャラシ参考\nhttps://character-sheets.appspot.com/2s/edit.html?key=ahVzfmNoYXJhY3Rlci1zaGVldHMtbXByFwsSDUNoYXJhY3RlckRhdGEYhPOp9QIM\n\nまた塗り方は厚塗りでお願いします。\n\n細かい部分の調整は木製様にお任せします。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@_w0oden_/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bf31df8/requests/180012_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aa1123ca789b8c6ffbbcbc1a735a07f6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5bf31df8/requests/180012_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aa1123ca789b8c6ffbbcbc1a735a07f6, https://si.imgix.net/5bf31df8/requests/180012_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=30eb3e6eae445dea3defeacf8f49df2a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5bf31df8/requests/180012_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ea2d3ecb4598d4a1ff4deeb4b2ed0a4c 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 406615, "nc": 1}, {"path": "/@_w0oden_/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 406615, "client_id": 742836, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/054b0cde/requests/150689_0?bg=%23fff&auto=for